<title>NIGERIA: Nigerian Coke bottler's nine months profits grow.</title>
<headline>Nigerian Coke bottler's nine months profits grow.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine-month results for Nigerian Bottling Company, the local bottlers of Coca-Cola, to end-September 1996.</p>
<p>(In million naira)</p>
<p>				    1996	  1995</p>
<p> Turnover			11,900 vs   11,600</p>
<p> Profit before taxation     1,200 vs    1,000</p>
<p> Taxation			   386 vs	322</p>
<p> Profit after taxation	  902 vs	753</p>
<p>($1=80 naira)</p>
<p>-- Lagos newsroom +234 1 263 03 17</p>
</text>
